{"id":"nevada","lemma":"nevada","pos":"noun","rank":4438,"glosses":["snowfall","snow storm"],"ipa":"/neˈbada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"nevadas"},"order":4439,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-nevada.wav","examples":[{"text":"Anoche cayó una gran nevada.","en":"It snowed a good deal last night.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706890","words":[{"g":"last night"},{"g":"to fall","l":"caer"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"El tren se retrasó debido a una fuerte nevada.","en":"The train was delayed on account of a heavy snow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635327","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"train"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to delay","l":"retrasar"},null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"strong"},null],"phrases":[[4,6,"due to"]]},{"text":"La fuerte nevada retrasó al tren durante varias horas.","en":"Heavy snow delayed the train for several hours.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"strong"},null,{"g":"to delay","l":"retrasar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"train"},{"g":"during, in, over"},{"g":"various","l":"vario"},{"g":"hour","l":"hora"}]}]}